msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaObservation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Rejected Media Observation"
msgstr "Observation de média refusé"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed observation reporting provider refusal of submitted media before recipient visibility. Its observed feature is the retained source record; its results describe refused parts, independently of delivered body parts or published media artifacts."
msgstr "Observation attribuée rapportant le refus par un fournisseur de médias soumis avant leur visibilité par le destinataire. Sa caractéristique observée est l’enregistrement source conservé ; ses résultats décrivent les parties refusées, indépendamment des parties livrées ou médias publiés."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this record or field."
msgstr "À employer lorsque la source fournit explicitement cet enregistrement ou ce champ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring identity, delivery, verification or execution from missing source evidence."
